a sporting, fighting chance
of doing something good.

809
00:39:31,933 --> 00:39:34,467
我很欣慰地宣布，
地面已经干了。
And I'm delighted to say
it has dried out.

810
00:39:34,567 --> 00:39:38,833
太棒了！所以现在是时候
把我们圈养的试车手
塞进这台Ascari里了。
Yes! So now it is time
to put our tamed driver
in the Ascari.

811
00:39:38,867 --> 00:39:42,600
有人说，他的皮肤
