重踩刹车！
Down to the first corner.
Hard on the brakes!

819
00:40:05,433 --> 00:40:08,033
入弯，轮胎尖叫不断。
这可不太妙。
Turning. Lots of tyre squeal.
That's a worry.

820
00:40:10,867 --> 00:40:12,833
