00:40:26,000 --> 00:40:28,667
这可能会暴露出
这台Ascari骨子里的
推头特性……
This could show up
the Ascari's
natural understeer...

827
00:40:28,700 --> 00:40:30,933
并没有，车身姿态
控制得很稳！
But, no, holding
it together nicely!

828
00:40:30,967 --> 00:40:33,100
