And kicking the tail out
on the exit.

829
00:40:35,433 --> 00:40:37,600
（古典乐播放中）
(CLASSICAL MUSIC PLAYING)

830
00:40:39,500 --> 00:40:42,167
不得不说，
就目前的表现来看，
