Up towards the tyres next.

833
00:40:48,933 --> 00:40:51,367
噢，太棒了！
这速度相当惊人！
Oh, yes!
That is extremely quick!

834
00:40:51,400 --> 00:40:53,500
现在只剩最后两个弯了。
Just two corners to go now.

835
00:40:53,533 --> 00:40:56,800
这台Ascari能否替大英帝国
