This is for the nation,
this is very important.

840
00:41:06,867 --> 00:41:09,900
1分20秒7！
1.20.7!

841
00:41:09,933 --> 00:41:12,767
简直让人叹为观止。
快看，它排在……
Which is astonishing.
Look at that. It goes...

842
00:41:14,133 --> 00:41:16,667
