If you ring the factory,
the phone just rings and rings

886
00:43:27,233 --> 00:43:28,567
根本没人接，
你懂的。
and no one picks it up,
you know.

887
00:43:28,567 --> 00:43:29,833
-这也太没礼貌了。
-就是，真没教养。
-That's just rude.
-It is just rude.

888
00:43:29,867 --> 00:43:32,233
拜托，罗孚，
